Eight separate cards are numbered $1$ to $8$. They are shuffled and one is drawn at random.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm]
\foreach \n in {1,...,8} {
\draw[draw=black] ({0.7*(\n-1)},0) rectangle ++(0.55,0.75);
\path ({0.7*(\n-1)+0.275},0.375) node[text=black,font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont] {\n};
}
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
(a) Find the probability of drawing $6$.
(b) Find the probability of drawing an odd number.
Give each answer as a fraction in simplest form.
